cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DentPanX-AI in research, please cite this software release and the associated manuscript."
title: "DentPanX-AI: A Software System for Multi-Class Dental Finding Detection in Panoramic Radiographs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "TURAN"
    given-names: "Gökhan"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22955972"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tulayturan/DentPanX-AI"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/tulayturan/DentPanX-AI/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22955972"
abstract: >-
  DentPanX-AI is research software integrating an RT-DETR-L object detector
  for seven MOPG-7 dataset-defined dental finding categories in panoramic
  radiographs. The repository includes versioned reproducibility materials,
  frozen data split assignments, archived training configurations,
  evaluation outputs, uncertainty-analysis materials, integrity checks,
  and a minimal automated smoke test.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - panoramic radiography
  - dental imaging
  - object detection
  - RT-DETR
  - reproducibility
